  title: The Bushes Provide
  description: 'Other demons use the bushes to stash their medical supplies for later.
    Sometimes they forget where they stashed it, or that they stashed it, so it just
    gets left there. They also sometimes die before retrieving it...

    I guess
    my point is look in bushes for medical supplies.'
